WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Defeat the Ultimate Level!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
SaberLeomon's Wrath

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.510
Defeat the Ultimate Level!

00:00:07.510 --> 00:00:09.550
SaberLeomon's Wrath!

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:16.140
Irritated by Mercurimon's decision not to act against the human world,

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:20.590
Gotsumon allied with SaberLeomon, Mercurimon's rival and war comrade,

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:24.890
and was given command over SaberLeomon's armies to attack the human world.

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:28.840
Their numbers were overwhelming.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.500
Just when our heroes thought they were goners...

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:35.610
It's showtime!

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:45.500
The Digital Gate that suddenly appeared forcibly sent the Digimon back to the Digital World.

00:00:52.450 --> 00:00:53.370
Ikuto-kun!

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:55.220
I'll leave your lunch right here.

00:00:55.910 --> 00:00:57.130
It's really good!

00:00:57.130 --> 00:00:59.800
After all, I put all of my skill into making it...

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:01.610
Sorry.

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:03.770
It was actually bought from the convenience store.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:10.110
But... you must eat something...

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:14.520
Ikuto, aren't you hungry?

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:16.320
Falcomon, you eat.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.560
It's definitely a Digital Gate.

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:30.050
From the looks of the situation, it appears that someone opened it on purpose.

00:01:30.050 --> 00:01:31.470
Is that possible?

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:33.500
It can't be done with DATS's equipment.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:37.970
Who on earth could've opened that large gate in such a broad area...?

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:39.590
Wasn't me.

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:40.200
Yeah...

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.300
Aniki couldn't have done it.

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.490
How's Ikuto?

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:48.080
No good.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:51.010
He doesn't respond and doesn't eat anything.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.190
Are you serious?

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:53.190
Isn't that...

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:55.650
Something to be really worried about, huh?

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:58.680
Who are you?

00:01:58.680 --> 00:01:59.590
Well, well, well...

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:00.820
Hello, hello.

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.190
You must be Agumon-san.

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:07.470
The first solid sample that was born within DATS

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:10.010
and has currently achieved evolution to the Perfect Level.

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:11.730
Your favorite food is fried eggs...

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:14.060
Oh, sorry!

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:16.110
How do you know about me?

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.690
Well, I'm a huge Digimon otaku!

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:20.840
NOTE: <i>Otaku</i> (オタク) refers to someone who has a highly obsessed interest in something.

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:22.590
You...

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:24.810
Is that you, Kurata-kun?

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:27.340
Satsuma-san!

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:28.520
I haven't seen you in awhile.

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:32.630
Oh, but your actions are still talked about.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.390
What? You guys know each other?

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:35.140
That's right!

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:38.190
He's also the man you should thank for the other day!

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:39.970
Governor Hashiba.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:42.360
He was the one who opened the Digital Gate.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:46.100
Oh... we were lucky that it opened properly.

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:48.120
Who knows what would have happened if I'd failed.

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:51.710
I was surprised to learn that <i>you</i>  were Daimon Masaru-kun.

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:53.040
Kurata-kun told me all about it.

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:57.040
He was an assistant to your father, Professor Suguru,

00:02:57.040 --> 00:03:00.990
and was also a part of the Digital World Exploration Squad ten years ago.

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:05.450
Daimon Masaru-kun, you've grown so big.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:08.190
You're looking more and more like your father.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:15.100
According to regulations, any Digimon that appear in the human world must be returned to a Digiegg first.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:19.420
You may be right, but that was an emergency situation.

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.320
Anyway, what I'd like to talk about is...

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:23.940
Ikuto-kun... Was that his name?

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:29.090
I hear he was raised in the Digital World, and I'm very interested in meeting him.

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:31.420
Could you give me custody over him?

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:31.790
Hey!

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:35.180
The original plan was to have him looked after by us, anyway.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:36.200
I'll give you my permission.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.040
Hang on!

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:38.500
You haven't even asked Ikuto if he'd agree!

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:41.670
You can't go!

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:42.470
Captain!

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:43.470
Ikuto-kun is...!

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:43.470
Let go!

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:45.260
Don't!

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:45.260
That guy...!

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:47.210
Wait, Ikuto!

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:48.470
Shut up! Let go!

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:50.340
Ikuto!

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:51.930
Thinking of sneaking out again, are we?!

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:54.270
Everyone would be better off without me!

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:56.200
Where are you even gonna go?

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:57.770
You don't have any place in mind, do you?!

00:03:59.620 --> 00:04:00.730
Masaru...

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:02.690
In that case, come to my place!

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:05.330
I'll look after you!

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:07.070
You don't need to worry about anything!

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:12.550
Captain! That's the way it is!

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:13.620
That's the way <i>what</i>  is?

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:16.160
This matter isn't for you to decide!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:16.940
I'll allow it.

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:20.880
This is a part of DATS's responsibility.

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:22.460
I ask that you please do not interfere.

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.270
That's true.

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:27.420
I have no choice but to give up, then.

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:28.800
Come now, let's go.

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:31.650
That's just like the Captain!

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:33.230
Really, you...

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.380
Ikuto...

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:37.690
Well, see you.

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:42.030
Kurata, huh?

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.340
I'm home!

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:46.340
Welcome back!

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:48.910
Oh? Do we have guests?

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:50.390
Yeah, my friends.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.430
This is Ikuto.

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:53.600
Welcome!

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:57.560
Interesting face paint you have on.

00:05:58.110 --> 00:05:59.420
This is my sister, Chika.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.460
Nice to meet you!

00:06:01.470 --> 00:06:04.700
Oh, Agu-chan, what are you wearing that for again?

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:05.570
Ah, this guy is...

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:09.080
Don't be so rude in front of a guest!

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:10.110
Come on!

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:23.340
Um...

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:24.310
I...

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:29.580
I... I...!

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:31.350
Stink.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:33.940
You guys stink!

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.490
Hurry and take a bath!

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:40.320
For crying out loud...

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:47.160
Dirty people aren't allowed inside!

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.980
I've put the towels over there, so don't get the floor wet!

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:57.170
All right, guess I'll join them too, then.

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:04.460
Aniki, me too!

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:07.000
Aniki?

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.000
What's wrong?

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:10.490
Hurry and get in.

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:11.630
Get in where?!

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:17.340
Well, let me introduce everyone again.

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:18.590
This guy is called Ikuto.

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:20.060
The other one is called Bird.

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:21.210
It's Falcomon!

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:21.210
It's Falcomon!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.430
Ah, they talked.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:23.480
Nice to meet you.

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:27.440
Well then!

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:29.400
Thank you for the-

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:29.400
Thank you for the-

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.580
FOOD!

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.580
FOOD!

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:35.140
If you don't hurry, there'll be nothing left to eat.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.780
I'm not gonna lose to you guys!

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:52.340
Gimme seconds!

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:55.790
If we don't hurry, there'll be nothing left to eat.

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:12.270
Did you see that?!

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:13.200
Damn, not bad.

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:16.020
All right, it's your turn, Ikuto.

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:30.210
It fell...

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:31.790
It fell...

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:31.790
It fell...

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.040
He gets a forehead poke!

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.710
Forehead poke!

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:38.280
Forehead poke-poke!

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.530
No!!

00:08:40.530 --> 00:08:42.040
You can't escape!

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:44.520
They're all so childish.

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.690
They drained all of the hot water!

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:52.190
But...

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:56.810
Perhaps it's because of Agu-chan's presence that this house has become so lively. I'm glad.

00:08:56.810 --> 00:08:59.660
The only thing Masaru-niichan ever did in the past was pick fights.

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:01.100
Yes.

00:09:00.440 --> 00:09:01.100
Take this!

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:04.100
The way he runs about wildly every day hasn't changed though.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:09.120
You hit me!

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:10.480
Try to get me!

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:25.950
Sa... SaberLeomon-sama!

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:27.560
Is that you, Gotsumon?

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:28.480
My...

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:30.560
My sincerest apologies!

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:33.280
Those filthy humans... I was so close...!

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:38.240
Gotsumon, do you still remember the worst day of our lives?

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:39.860
Of course...

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:40.950
Of course I do!

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:50.900
A gust of frightening energy from the human world caused a strong typhoon.

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:55.610
The humans crossed through the storm to trespass into the Digital world,

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:58.260
and killed our companions!

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:01.710
Unforgivable!

00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:03.430
Completely unforgivable!

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:08.020
As such, I shall exact revenge on the humans myself!

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:09.640
Th-Then...

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:11.020
Allow me to...!

00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:12.010
I do not need you!

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:15.610
Under Mercurimon's weak-hearted ruling, the support of others is no longer of any use to me!

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:21.070
I, alone, will let those humans taste my wrath!

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:27.570
Pee...

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:41.290
Yukidarumon...

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:44.370
I've got you!

00:10:47.820 --> 00:10:50.830
Oh, Ikuto-kun, you're up.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.480
Did you sleep well?

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:01.950
Ikuto-kun!

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:07.170
What? You need to use the restroom, too?

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:07.790
Move!

00:11:08.470 --> 00:11:09.670
I'm leaving!

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:10.250
Why?

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:11.680
I'm leaving!

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:13.800
Why?! You can stay here!

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:14.770
No!

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:16.050
No! No!

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:17.020
Ikuto!

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:19.590
Hey, Ikuto!

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:19.900
What's wrong?

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:23.250
Yeah?

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:27.090
An Ultimate Level Digimon?!

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:52.400
SaberLeomon has appeared in Area F470.

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:53.370
Heavy damage is sustained!

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:57.480
The western route has been successfully cut off. Area F420 has been evacuated.

00:11:57.480 --> 00:11:59.300
The situation is critical!

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:01.720
Okay. I'll be right there.

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:05.930
Let go!

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:09.870
You're not thinking of sacrificing yourself again, are you?

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:10.560
Ikuto!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:13.890
If I go, attacks might stop.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.380
Everything...

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.730
Everything my fault!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:19.230
Are you stupid?

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:20.940
I not stupid!

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.010
Then why are you saying it's your fault?

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:24.990
Don't believe that crap those guys told you!

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:28.370
You didn't do anything wrong!

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:28.950
But...

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:32.270
Was last night's meal good?

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:38.560
Listen.

00:12:38.560 --> 00:12:42.750
Normally we'd be having more of that good food for breakfast right now,

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:45.630
but now we have to throw everything down and move out.

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:48.430
All because of that whatever-it-was-called Digimon!

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:53.390
Anyone who doesn't let a guy eat must be served <i>justice</i> !

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:58.810
Masaru...

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:01.780
Stop wasting time saying weird things, just hurry up and move!

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:03.600
But...

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:05.610
Can't beat SaberLeomon!

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.170
Is that why you won't fight?

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:10.830
You'll never win in the first place if you don't even step into the fight.

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:12.590
I'm going.

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:14.900
Dressed like that?

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:16.040
Say that sooner.

00:13:16.440 --> 00:13:19.070
Masaru, I'll keep the food warmed for you.

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:20.180
Sorry 'bout this, Mom.

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:23.010
But I'm so hungry...

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:25.500
If you have any requests, I'll make them for you.

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:26.930
I want fried eggs!

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:28.010
I want curry!

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:29.090
Then...

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:30.810
I'll make fried egg curry!

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:32.060
Yay!

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:32.060
Yay!

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:34.850
What about you, Ikuto-kun?

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:37.030
I-I...

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.520
I'll have the same as Ikuto!

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.580
It's decided then!

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.110
Let's go!

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:44.040
Yeah!

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.430
Lila Shower!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.210
Lilamon!

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:54.870
Bastard!

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:58.000
Take this!

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:19.690
Digimon who team up with humans... What pathetic idiots.

00:14:20.180 --> 00:14:23.150
Feel the wrath of my blade!

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:24.690
Hang on!

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:29.390
Don't think you can get away with whatever you want on my turf, you bastard!

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:30.880
That's right!

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:39.460
A weak human like you seeks a fight with me?

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:42.900
Aniki!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.110
Let me handle it!

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:44.940
All right!

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:46.810
Digisoul...

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:52.710
Full Charge!

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.950
Agumon, evolve!

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:13.910
RiseGreymon!

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:16.240
What eyesores.

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:18.560
MachGaogamon, can you still fight?

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:19.450
Of course.

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:21.090
Lilamon?

00:15:21.090 --> 00:15:22.120
I'm fine.

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:24.330
All right, let's do this, guys!

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:24.960
Right!

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:24.960
Right!

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:33.340
I can feel a Digimon's presence coming from this direction!

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:35.450
Over there!

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:37.760
Come on!

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:40.770
Howling Cannon!

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:42.860
Lila Shower!

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:45.390
Trident Revolver!

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:53.800
Nail Crusher!

00:15:57.800 --> 00:15:59.240
Beauty Slap!

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:01.010
Infinity Arrow!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:04.330
Winning Knuckle!

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:11.760
Weak...

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:12.760
Too weak!

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.160
Wow...

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:18.640
The attacks of three Perfect Levels are totally useless!

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.100
They're beaten this badly after just one hit?

00:16:22.780 --> 00:16:25.310
Is the Ultimate Level really that strong?

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:28.520
Now, give in quietly!

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:30.110
MachGaogamon!

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:33.610
Stop!

00:16:35.210 --> 00:16:36.630
I-Ikuto!

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:38.580
Ikuto?

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:40.710
I see... I've heard of you...

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:43.520
Humans destroyed Digimon's world.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:44.370
But...

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:47.830
Digimon destroying human world, not good!

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:50.850
The fact remains that you are a human.

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:53.840
You wouldn't understand the Digimon's suffering.

00:16:54.390 --> 00:16:55.010
You're wrong!

00:16:55.010 --> 00:16:56.220
Out of the way!

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.150
Ikuto!

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:04.440
Are you okay?

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:07.710
I... want to stop SaberLeomon...

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:08.830
But...

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:09.800
Idiot!

00:17:09.800 --> 00:17:11.940
Worry more about breakfast!

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:14.700
Hey, SaberLeomon!

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:18.160
How dare you attack the defenseless Ikuto!

00:17:18.160 --> 00:17:20.850
I've decided, you are going down!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:22.660
You think you can take me on, bastard?

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:24.180
Try me and see!

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:25.160
RiseGreymon!

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:28.680
Stand up, RiseGreymon!

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:30.470
Aniki...

00:17:30.470 --> 00:17:31.680
Sorry...

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:33.590
I can't... muster enough energy...

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:35.010
It's useless.

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:38.450
No one can stand after absorbing my Nail Crusher...

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:47.550
Who are you?

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:48.270
Out of my way!

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:55.430
I told you to get lost!

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.760
Wh... What...?

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:06.620
It disappeared! What was that?!

00:18:07.260 --> 00:18:09.580
Something's wrong with SaberLeomon!

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:15.760
Don't look around when you're in the middle of a fight!

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:17.730
Take a good look, Ikuto!

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:20.440
SaberLeomon!

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:23.200
Feel Ikuto's pain!

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:31.850
The Ultimate Level's fang...

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:31.850
The Ultimate Level's fang...

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:33.150
...broke?!

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:33.150
...broke?!

00:18:33.450 --> 00:18:34.500
Aniki...

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:35.400
That's amazing...!

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:40.070
Come on! Show 'em what you've got!

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:45.280
All right!

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:47.740
You must be... kidding me...

00:18:47.740 --> 00:18:49.250
Being beaten by scum like you...

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:51.950
Trident Revolver!

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.720
Filthy...

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:02.570
Filthy humans!!

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:11.850
Man, I'm hungry.

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:16.310
Today's curry has gotta be good!

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:16.910
Right?

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:23.400
Yeah.

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:26.410
Aniki!

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:27.500
The Digiegg!

00:19:33.580 --> 00:19:35.340
It disappeared...

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.130
Hey, what's going on?

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:39.420
Well, that was a magnificent display!

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:43.180
I am moved, I am deeply impressed!

00:19:43.710 --> 00:19:45.020
Why are you here?

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:47.610
Let's just say I was in the neighborhood.

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:51.350
Anyway, what was that Digimon just now?

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:54.700
I've never seen that Digimon before...

00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:57.290
Even DATS's databank has no information on it.

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:59.360
It's an unknown Digimon, huh?

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:01.460
It certainly was strong.

00:20:01.460 --> 00:20:05.540
If it hadn't provided an opening for attack, things could have become dangerous.

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:08.900
Oh, but it was Agumon-san who gave the finishing blow!

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:13.380
In any case, this is quite troublesome.

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:17.640
The Digimon are fully regarding us humans as their enemy.

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:20.000
We must do something about this.

00:20:20.540 --> 00:20:23.610
Don't you agree, Doctor Tohma?

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:42.820
Well then...

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:44.790
Thank you for the-

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:44.790
Thank you for the-

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:45.500
FOOD!

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:45.500
FOOD!

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:50.750
How do you like Mom's special fried egg curry?

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:51.790
Delicious!

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:54.370
There are plenty of seconds.

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:02.940
You better clean well, or else Chika will come after you.

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:04.020
Okay...

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:08.040
Hey, is it...

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:12.720
Is it really okay for me to... be here?

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:14.520
Huh?

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:17.560
Never mind...

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:25.150
Of course it is.

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:27.970
Aniki, I'm gonna wash, too!

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:29.130
Me, too!

00:21:29.130 --> 00:21:31.800
Hey, I told you, we can't all fit in here!

